1. In [src/nemotron_voice/bot.py](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-nano-omni/src/nemotron_voice/bot.py:313), `UserAudioContextCollector` now uses a duration-tracked rolling lookback deque instead of frame-count trimming, keeps one active capture alive across interim VAD pauses, and records the latest `VADUserStoppedSpeakingFrame` boundary separately from final turn commit. On `UserStoppedSpeakingFrame` and `EndFrame`/`CancelFrame`, it commits `active_capture[:last_vad_stop]` when that boundary exists, otherwise falls back to the current active capture for the watchdog-timeout path; any post-final-VAD audio is carried into the next lookback buffer. The collector also now read-clears `InterruptedToolPassSignal` by prepending `<user_interruption></user_interruption> ` to the committed audio message text when flagged. In `run_bot`, the same shared signal is passed into the collector and the pipeline comment now documents why the collector must stay ahead of the LLM in that branch [bot.py](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-nano-omni/src/nemotron_voice/bot.py:572).

2. In [tests/test_nemotron_omni_aligned.py](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-nano-omni/tests/test_nemotron_omni_aligned.py:475), I added a synthetic-audio harness plus these step-7 tests: `test_audio_collector_preserves_full_lookback_with_variable_frame_sizes`, `test_audio_collector_resumes_same_turn_after_mid_pause`, `test_audio_collector_tracks_latest_vad_stop_and_commits_on_user_stopped`, `test_audio_collector_excludes_post_final_vad_stop_audio_from_committed_turn_and_carries_it_forward`, `test_audio_collector_timeout_without_fresh_vad_stop_commits_current_active_capture`, and `test_audio_collector_prepends_user_interruption_marker_when_flagged` [tests/test_nemotron_omni_aligned.py](/home/khkramer/src/nemotron-nano-omni/tests/test_nemotron_omni_aligned.py:3241). Verification passed: `PYTHONPATH=src uv run --with-editable ./pipecat-core-code --with websockets --with python-dotenv --group asr --group vllm-test python -m pytest -q tests/test_nemotron_omni_aligned.py tests/test_nemotron_omni_conversation_cache.py` -> `64 passed`; smoke import -> `imports-ok`.

